<section class="band band--paper" id="pricing">
  <div class="plock">
    <img alt="Google Ads" src="/img/mark-google.webp">
    <span>Google Ads management</span>
  </div>
  <div class="phead">
    <h2>Management pricing by monthly ad spend</h2>
    <p>Management is the same at every level. The difference is how much ad spend we are
      running on your behalf, so you only step up when the results justify it.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pgrid">
    <div class="pcard">
      <div class="pc-top">
        <span class="pc-tier">Layup</span>
        <span class="pc-price">$139/<small>week</small></span>
      </div>
      <p class="pc-desc">Ad spend up to <b>$1,500 per month.</b> $30 to $40 a day sits inside this, with room to lift spend later without the fee changing.</p>
      <a class="pc-btn" href="#contact">Get started</a>
      <p class="pc-micro">Billed monthly. Cancel any time (60 days notice)</p>
      <div class="pc-inc-label">Included:</div>
      <ul class="pc-inc">
        <li><span class="pc-ball"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="b-fill" cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path class="b-seam" d="M4 7.5c3.2 1.8 5.2 5 5.2 9M20 7.5c-3.2 1.8-5.2 5-5.2 9M4.5 15.5c3-1.2 6-1.5 8-4s2.5-6 3-9"/></svg></span><span>End-to-end management</span></li>
        <li><span class="pc-ball"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="b-fill" cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path class="b-seam" d="M4 7.5c3.2 1.8 5.2 5 5.2 9M20 7.5c-3.2 1.8-5.2 5-5.2 9M4.5 15.5c3-1.2 6-1.5 8-4s2.5-6 3-9"/></svg></span><span>Full campaign setup</span></li>
        <li><span class="pc-ball"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="b-fill" cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path class="b-seam" d="M4 7.5c3.2 1.8 5.2 5 5.2 9M20 7.5c-3.2 1.8-5.2 5-5.2 9M4.5 15.5c3-1.2 6-1.5 8-4s2.5-6 3-9"/></svg></span><span>Conversion tracking</span></li>
        <li><span class="pc-ball"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="b-fill" cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path class="b-seam" d="M4 7.5c3.2 1.8 5.2 5 5.2 9M20 7.5c-3.2 1.8-5.2 5-5.2 9M4.5 15.5c3-1.2 6-1.5 8-4s2.5-6 3-9"/></svg></span><span>Advanced keyword research</span></li>
        <li><span class="pc-ball"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="b-fill" cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path class="b-seam" d="M4 7.5c3.2 1.8 5.2 5 5.2 9M20 7.5c-3.2 1.8-5.2 5-5.2 9M4.5 15.5c3-1.2 6-1.5 8-4s2.5-6 3-9"/></svg></span><span>New ads monthly</span></li>
        <li><span class="pc-ball"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="b-fill" cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path class="b-seam" d="M4 7.5c3.2 1.8 5.2 5 5.2 9M20 7.5c-3.2 1.8-5.2 5-5.2 9M4.5 15.5c3-1.2 6-1.5 8-4s2.5-6 3-9"/></svg></span><span>Ad copy testing</span></li>
        <li><span class="pc-ball"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="b-fill" cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path class="b-seam" d="M4 7.5c3.2 1.8 5.2 5 5.2 9M20 7.5c-3.2 1.8-5.2 5-5.2 9M4.5 15.5c3-1.2 6-1.5 8-4s2.5-6 3-9"/></svg></span><span>Transparent reports</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard pcard--feat">
      <div class="pc-top">
        <span class="pc-tier">Alley-oop</span>
        <span class="pc-price">$185/<small>week</small></span>
      </div>
      <p class="pc-desc">Ad spend up to <b>$3,000 per month.</b> The step up once the first months justify putting more behind it.</p>
      <a class="pc-btn" href="#contact">Get started</a>
      <p class="pc-micro">Billed monthly. Cancel any time (60 days notice)</p>
      <div class="pc-inc-label">Included:</div>
      <ul class="pc-inc">
        <li><span class="pc-ball"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="b-fill" cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path class="b-seam" d="M4 7.5c3.2 1.8 5.2 5 5.2 9M20 7.5c-3.2 1.8-5.2 5-5.2 9M4.5 15.5c3-1.2 6-1.5 8-4s2.5-6 3-9"/></svg></span><span>End-to-end management</span></li>
        <li><span class="pc-ball"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="b-fill" cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path class="b-seam" d="M4 7.5c3.2 1.8 5.2 5 5.2 9M20 7.5c-3.2 1.8-5.2 5-5.2 9M4.5 15.5c3-1.2 6-1.5 8-4s2.5-6 3-9"/></svg></span><span>Full campaign setup</span></li>
